  "headline": "CAF Nominates Flamingos Coach Busari For Coach Of The Year Award",
  "seoTitle": "CAF Nominates Coach Busari For Award",
  "metaDescription": "Following the historic World Cup win, Nigeria's U-17 women's coach Akeem Busari has been shortlisted for the CAF Women's Coach of the Year award.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Akeem Busari has been shortlisted for the 2026 Confederation of African Football Women’s Coach of the Year award.",
    "The nomination follows Busari’s leadership of the Nigeria U-17 women’s national team to a 2-1 World Cup final victory over Japan.",
    "Busari is one of ten coaches recognized by the CAF for the annual honor."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Nigeria U-17 women’s national football team, known as the Flamingos, recently secured a historic title by becoming the first African nation to win the U-17 Women's World Cup. The squad achieved this milestone after defeating Japan in the final tournament held in Morocco. In recognition of this success, the team's head coach, Akeem Busari, has been nominated for the Confederation of African Football (CAF) Women’s Coach of the Year award. He is one of ten professionals shortlisted for the honor. The victory has generated significant national attention, with various officials and public figures praising the team for ending Africa’s long-standing title drought in the competition. The team has since returned to Abuja, and individual players and staff members continue to receive accolades for their performance in the international tournament.",
